window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When you survive an ordeal like I did at such a young age, people tend to label you a victim. That will never be me. I am a fighter. </p> <p>The past does not define me. So when my secret savior comes out of the shadows to prove his love, I do what I do best, fight. Against my family, enemies, and my own heart. </p> <p>Because how could I have found true love during the worst time of my life? </p> <p>My name is Dorian Cole, SAA of the MorningStar MC, and I make my own rules.</p>"; 
